OL,3,GNEWSATen councillors quit after
OL,4,Aleader's fraud conviction
OL,5,
OL,6,FTen Ashfield Independent councillors
OL,7,Fhave quit the party this week following
OL,8,Fthe former leader's fraud conviction.
OL,10,FJason Zadrozny was accused of setting
OL,11,Fup a fake heritage group to defraud
OL,12,FNottinghamshire County Council out of
OL,13,Fthousands of pounds and was found
OL,14,Fguilty last month.
OL,16,FHe resigned as leader of Ashfield
OL,17,FDistrict Council the following day but
OL,18,Fwas later given a seat on the
OL,19,Fauthority's planning committee.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
