OL,3,GNEWSATen councillors quit after
OL,4,Aleader's fraud conviction
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs of Thursday, 13 councillors are
OL,7,Fsitting as non-aligned independents
OL,8,Fwhile 18 Ashfield Independents remain,
OL,9,Fmeaning the party is one councillor
OL,10,Faway from losing its majority.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
